# 🎯 Marketing Strategist — UI Layout Documentation

> A premium dark-themed interactive web application that teaches users how to think like a real marketing strategist through an 8-step guided simulation.

---

# 🎨 Design Style

- Theme: Dark Premium
- Primary Accent: Amber / Gold (#F0A93D)
- Secondary: Blue, Green, Red
- Background: #10141B
- Cards: Glassmorphism + Soft Borders
- Font:
  - Space Grotesk (Headings)
  - Inter (Body)
  - Caveat (Sticky Notes)

---

